#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:3
#: 9e6dc036a2b0428e8af541ebfa530843
msgid "超胞生成（Super Cell）"
msgstr "Super Cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:5
#: 0902ae1ac75745f09410433f2e1350a4
msgid "`Group`: `Lattice` | `Class`: `SuperCellCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:7
#: 2ef81e86510f42efa13a9e771f12a03a
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:9
#: 3e63caf8ce364ee486a0d2e8dc0565e9
msgid ""
"按倍率、目标胞长或原子数上限扩胞，为缺陷/表面/磁性操作提供足够空间。三种扩胞策略三选一：固定倍率（`scale`）、目标胞长（`cell`）、原子数上限（`max_atoms`）。可锁定特定轴向不扩胞——适合"
" slab 等需要维持法向层间距的场景。"
msgstr ""
"Expand a structure by fixed replication, target cell lengths, or an atom-"
"count limit so downstream defect, surface, and magnetic operations have "
"enough space. Choose one strategy: `scale`, `cell`, or `max_atoms`. "
"Individual axes can be locked, which is useful for preserving the normal "
"direction of a slab."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:11
#: ef80eff14c8c4324baf85fe1b97e53ca
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{T}=\\mathrm{diag}(n_a,n_b,n_c),\\quad "
"\\mathbf{C}'=\\mathbf{C}\\mathbf{T},\\quad N'=N\\cdot n_a n_b n_c"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:13
#: 9dd6fcfa4bb94e5d9c3d5de7433f51bb
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:15
#: 61818b93c52d4baabad12ac1fc7e21e7
msgid "场景：模型在小胞上训练后跑空位计算，周期镜像干扰导致空位形成能偏高 0.5 eV"
msgstr "Scenario: Periodic images raise the vacancy formation energy by 0.5 eV"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:17
#: 8bb438a3bcc341e38970203907a70bb6
msgid ""
"你在 bcc Fe 上用 2x2x2 超胞（16 原子）训练了一个 NEP 模型。拿这个模型算单空位形成能，结果比 DFT 高了 0.5 "
"eV。诊断发现：2x2x2 太小的胞里，空位和它的周期镜像之间距离只有约 5 "
"Å，空位-空位镜像相互作用不可忽略，模型学到的实际上是\"带镜像相互作用的空位\"而非孤立空位。"
msgstr ""
"A bcc Fe NEP is trained on 2x2x2 cells with 16 atoms and overestimates a "
"single-vacancy formation energy by 0.5 eV. The vacancy is only about 5 Å "
"from its periodic images, so the training environment represents interacting"
" vacancy images rather than an isolated defect."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:19
#: f730b78f78a94198b6cfacfe639d672c
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 缺陷计算的黄金法则是\"超胞要大到使缺陷-缺陷镜像相互作用可忽略\"。2x2x2 = 16 "
"原子的胞对空位来说太小。解法是在训练集里用更大的超胞（至少 3x3x3 = 54 原子或 4x4x4 = 128 "
"原子）做空位计算，这样模型至少见过大胞里的空位环境。同时，下游做空位操作时也需要大胞作为母结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Defect cells must be large enough that interactions between "
"periodic defect images are negligible for the target accuracy. Add vacancy "
"labels in larger cells, for example 3x3x3 or 4x4x4, and use such cells as "
"parents for downstream defect generation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:21
#: 7f05eabf33da453d8a584826b31b07ee
msgid "**输入：** 一个 bcc Fe 原胞（2 原子）"
msgstr "**Input:** A two-atom bcc Fe primitive cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:23
#: 419d07a797e54b24b26ed6b77f70467e
msgid "**目标：** 扩到 4x4x4 超胞（128 原子），为后续空位缺陷生成提供母结构"
msgstr "**Objective:** Build a 4x4x4, 128-atom parent for vacancy generation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:25
#: cec93d4eb7ce41b1851f27aae2a48bc3
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:26
#: fffb3d53791c4e77bc9495513ae71862
msgid "mode = `scale`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:27
#: 397750f3c6d143d8b54590ec47d7542d
msgid "`super_scale` = `[4, 4, 4]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:29
#: 9957016ceb114b3683f6b90ff20ee586
msgid "**输出：** 1 个 4x4x4 超胞结构，128 原子"
msgstr "**Output:** One 4x4x4 supercell with 128 atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:31
#: 8d4bc42e8629423daafd49c1ea453d82
msgid "**怎么验证结果合理：**"
msgstr "**How to verify the result:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:32
#: 19ee6e9249c54984a6853de4c11121b5
msgid "检查原子数：原胞 2 原子 * 4 * 4 * 4 = 128，核对输出"
msgstr "Check atom count: 2 × 4 × 4 × 4 = 128."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:33
#: cf023849f2e747058b09b0f604f48909
msgid "检查晶格矢量：每个方向拉长 4 倍，体积增大 64 倍"
msgstr ""
"Check lattice vectors: each is four times longer and volume is 64 times "
"larger."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:34
#: 5936a58099fd4933aff663b091f22c05
msgid "如果空位形成能仍偏高，继续增大到 5x5x5 = 250 原子，直到 DFT 和 NEP 的形成能收敛"
msgstr ""
"If the vacancy formation energy remains size dependent, repeat at larger "
"cells until the chosen DFT and NEP comparisons are converged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:35
#: cb858f78770c4c738bf5fc4f300505a6
msgid "如果超胞太大计算不起，用 `max_atoms` 模式设置预算上限"
msgstr ""
"If larger cells exceed the labeling budget, use `max_atoms` to impose a hard"
" size limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:37
#: ee3ccf41dc154c96b0bbdeff72c4afb7
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:39
#: ae99104193454b68ac46943c862d43db
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:40
#: 1071af5df0524d45b779aeb07866bd29
msgid "下游要做缺陷（空位、间隙）、表面（slab）、磁性操作，需要超胞作为母结构"
msgstr ""
"Downstream vacancies, interstitials, surfaces, or magnetic patterns need a "
"larger parent cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:41
#: a4c27f062a2e4fba909e492a7fc87a73
msgid "当前训练集胞太小，周期镜像干扰不可忽略"
msgstr "Periodic-image interactions are not negligible in current cells"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:42
#: 900d787efd2f4581809695bfe01c3b69
msgid "需要扩胞以使 defect-defect 距离 > 10 Å"
msgstr "A specified minimum defect-image separation is required"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:44
#: 708c7a8d028d4875b63ca221f37c304d
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:45
#: 63c5dfced7f346eb9f24e938caae20ec
msgid "下游任务是体相性质（弹性常数、声子），原胞/小胞就够 —— 扩胞只会白增计算量"
msgstr "The task is a bulk property already converged in the primitive or small cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:46
#: 42da4109cbf946a9bb3aa9d3cb4fd4f2
msgid "计算预算严重受限，扩胞后 DFT 跑不动 —— 这种情况下维持小胞，接受周期镜像有残留误差"
msgstr ""
"The DFT budget cannot support the expanded cell and the remaining finite-"
"size error is explicitly accepted"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:47
#: 92e6cdf7a2184fee8eb993965145ff99
msgid "需要的是带应变的晶格变化而非单纯的重复复制 —— 用 `Lattice Strain` 或 `Cell Scaling`"
msgstr ""
"Cell deformation rather than replication is needed; use `Lattice Strain` or "
"`Lattice Perturb`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:49
#: c8f6d159db904f0a8356069fd35f07bd
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:51
#: 7d66db94898d46908358f48887f34f1c
msgid "扩胞策略"
msgstr "Expansion strategy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:53
#: 780d83d437984a15a51cc7080e91c3c7
msgid "Behavior Type（behavior_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:55
#: 80dfd0143bf24a11845422deccd0ffe2
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。控制输出哪些超胞。`0` = 单输出：scale 模式输出刚好那个倍数；cell 模式输出最大或最小倍数的超胞；max_atoms"
" 模式输出原子数最大的那个。`1` = 枚举：从 1x1x1 到目标倍数，所有中间组合都输出——适合想一次生成多个不同大小的超胞。`2` = "
"最小满足：cell 模式用 ceil 取整（至少达到目标长度），max_atoms 模式同理——适合\"至少多大才够\"的场景。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Selects outputs. `0` returns one requested/selected "
"cell; `1` enumerates intermediate replication combinations from 1x1x1 "
"through the target; `2` uses the smallest replication that meets a target, "
"including ceiling behavior for target lengths. Estimate enumeration size "
"before using mode 1."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:57
#: cb6c199332b4459d9f76eb2034363439
msgid "Mode（mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:59
#: 144b5ab7330140af9d7b120951e2a84f
msgid ""
"`SuperCellMode`，默认 `'scale'`。`\"scale\"` 按 `super_scale` "
"里写死的倍数扩——你最清楚自己要多大时用这个。`\"cell\"` 按 `target_cell` 里的目标胞长（单位 Å）自动算倍数，每个方向的倍数 "
"= floor 或 ceil（目标长度/原始长度），取决于 `behavior_type`——想让胞长达到特定数值（比如所有方向大于等于 20 "
"Å）时用这个。`\"max_atoms\"` 按原子数上限枚举所有可能的倍数组合，输出所有不超过上限的超胞——预算受限时找最大可用超胞用这个。"
msgstr ""
"`SuperCellMode`, default `'scale'`. `scale` uses explicit `super_scale`; "
"`cell` derives per-axis replication from `target_cell` in Å using floor or "
"ceiling according to `behavior_type`; `max_atoms` searches replication "
"combinations under an atom-count cap. Use explicit scale when the required "
"cell is known, target lengths for separation constraints, and max atoms for "
"a budget-limited design."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:61
#: d2e368cdab9a4cffb15dd646b4d35494
msgid "Super Scale（super_scale）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:63
#: 6419e33c8ea34dd09fdd3a2b298dd83a
msgid ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(3, 3, 3)`。仅 scale 模式生效。a/b/c 方向各复制几倍，最小 "
"1（不复制），典型值 2~4。注意 3x3x3 = 27 倍原子数，提前心算一下总原子数别超预算。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(3, 3, 3)`; scale only. Replication along "
"a, b, and c, with minimum 1. Total atom count is multiplied by their "
"product."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:65
#: a34facf2e8ea4c63b571356428c64d3e
msgid "Target Cell（target_cell）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:67
#: 6369ff9e810d4f1ea967673c8ac7220e
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(20.0, 20.0, 20.0)`。仅 cell 模式生效。各方向的目标胞长，单位"
" Å。比如原胞 a 长度 = 5 Å 时，target=20 会算出倍数 4（或 5，取决于 behavior_type 是 floor 还是 "
"ceil）。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(20.0, 20.0, 20.0)` Å; cell only. "
"Target lengths by axis. Replication is derived from target/original length "
"and the selected floor/ceiling behavior."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:69
#: 0708fccc7d89499fa0b1757a30ce4fa8
msgid "Max Atoms（max_atoms）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:71
#: 39a3a8c383644f718d17212cf7fd45b9
msgid "`int`，默认 100。仅 max_atoms 模式生效。超胞总原子数上限，实际输出可能包含多个不超过此上限的不同倍数超胞。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`; max-atoms only. Upper bound on total atoms. "
"Enumeration behavior may emit several replication combinations below it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:73
#: 6a1fc47dfc144e428b6f28e70d873fb1
msgid "轴向锁定"
msgstr "Axis locking"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:75
#: 3ee6c719056b487285ec9e31624c5f75
msgid "Fixed Axis Flags（fixed_axis_flags）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:77
#: ccc33e765254467a9a0e70fbdffe7763
msgid ""
"`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`，默认 `(false, false, false)`。锁定 a/b/c 方向的扩胞倍数。最适合 "
"slab 场景：把法向（通常 c 轴）锁住不扩，只扩面内两个方向。被锁住的轴用 `fixed_axis_scale` 里对应的倍数，不被锁住的轴正常扩。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[bool, bool, bool]`, default `(false, false, false)`. Lock replication"
" along a, b, or c. For a slab, lock the normal and expand only in plane. "
"Locked axes use `fixed_axis_scale`; others follow the selected strategy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:79
#: e0660894d6f048a98185f2bd92fbbb6d
msgid "Fixed Axis Scale（fixed_axis_scale）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:81
#: e38be703c62a4970bd61d69b6e8917f1
msgid ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(1, 1, 1)`。仅对 `fixed_axis_flags` 中对应位置为 true "
"的轴生效。通常设为 1（不扩胞），但如果你需要一个方向固定扩 2 倍、另一个方向自由扩，也可以设成其他值。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `(1, 1, 1)`. Replication values for axes "
"enabled in `fixed_axis_flags`. Use 1 to preserve an axis or another fixed "
"integer when required."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:83
#: 7ce236a027dd41e89ee758390fdc14f0
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:85
#: 770fa7be1c184fa9840ac9e9d4bb67c4
msgid "快速扩胞（固定 3x3x3，单输出）"
msgstr "Direct 3x3x3 expansion (one output)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:86
#: b8096cc0b31945658e208e17e2d9a77f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SuperCellCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"mode\": \"scale\",\n"
"  \"behavior_type\": 0,\n"
"  \"super_scale\": [3, 3, 3],\n"
"  \"target_cell\": [20, 20, 20],\n"
"  \"max_atoms\": 100,\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_flags\": [false, false, false],\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_scale\": [1, 1, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:100
#: 72258858584648d4a53daccc9279cacd
msgid "Slab 扩胞（面内扩到 20 Å，法向锁 1x，枚举所有组合）"
msgstr "Slab expansion (20 Å in plane, normal locked at 1x, enumerate combinations)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:101
#: bfb7b20990114f3995d651d4b1058666
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SuperCellCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"mode\": \"cell\",\n"
"  \"behavior_type\": 1,\n"
"  \"super_scale\": [3, 3, 3],\n"
"  \"target_cell\": [20, 20, 20],\n"
"  \"max_atoms\": 100,\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_flags\": [false, false, true],\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_scale\": [1, 1, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:115
#: ac4338b4e31b4d84bce4c194286d96a9
msgid "预算限制下的最大超胞（≤ 300 原子，取最大）"
msgstr "Largest supercell under a 300-atom budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:116
#: edda18beac59430b928a0d4cc437e004
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SuperCellCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"mode\": \"max_atoms\",\n"
"  \"behavior_type\": 0,\n"
"  \"super_scale\": [3, 3, 3],\n"
"  \"target_cell\": [20, 20, 20],\n"
"  \"max_atoms\": 300,\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_flags\": [false, false, false],\n"
"  \"fixed_axis_scale\": [1, 1, 1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:130
#: e00908052f614fedbcc3478a1c5047c6
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:132
#: 84f40b1722fe45b2b3feddb830df66ce
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Vacancy Defect`：先扩胞再删原子，保证缺陷-镜像距离"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Vacancy Defect`: establish defect-image separation before "
"removing atoms"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:133
#: 3fba2425e7da42569bfbb269b99ad34c
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Lattice Strain`：扩胞后做应变扫描"
msgstr "`Super Cell` -> `Lattice Strain`: strain the target-size cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:134
#: aed4ab5a77164c02a256416f1cc5971c
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Surface Warp`：扩胞后做表面起伏"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Surface Warp`: create surface variation after in-plane "
"expansion"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:135
#: 737b869c3fd546c09ea067bf6d99a3b2
msgid "`Super Cell` → `FPS Filter`：枚举模式产生大量超胞时，用 FPS 去重（相同大小的超胞只有 1 个有用）"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `FPS Filter`: reduce redundant outputs from an intentionally"
" broad enumeration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:137
#: e9fed651bed149eb81ee8cf6eeb02192
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:139
#: 654a657950d54c8ca2880c998ab20c13
msgid ""
"**输出只有 1x1x1（等于没扩胞）。** 如果原胞自身已经满足目标——例如原胞 3 Å、target_cell=20、behavior_type=0"
" 时倍数=6，但原胞 a 长度已经 25 Å —— 倍数被截断为 1。检查 target_cell 是否设得比原胞还小。或者在 max_atoms "
"模式下，原胞原子数已超上限，只输出原胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Only 1x1x1 is returned.** The input may already meet `target_cell`, or its"
" atom count may already exceed `max_atoms`. Compare target lengths and "
"budget with the input cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:141
#: 57f17dc26ea543c29f3afbb6fb2dd9b1
msgid ""
"**Slab 面内方向扩胞不均匀。** `fixed_axis_flags` 只锁了法向，面内两个方向各走各的倍数。如果面内需要正方形胞，确保 "
"target_cell 的 a/b 目标值一致，或者用 scale 模式手动统一倍数。"
msgstr ""
"**A slab expands unevenly in plane.** Unlocked axes choose replication "
"independently. Use equal a/b targets or explicit scale when a square in-"
"plane cell is required."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:143
#: 1072ada7d3c44598806cbc6b9b8503ac
msgid ""
"**原子数暴增超出计算预算。** 4x4x4 = 64 倍原子数。先心算：倍数 = (na*nb*nc)，原子数 = 原胞原子数 * 倍数。谨慎选择 "
"behavior_type=1（枚举模式），因为从 1x1x1 到目标倍数会产生多个不同大小的超胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Atom count exceeds the budget.** Compute `n_input × na × nb × nc` first. "
"Enumeration mode also emits multiple sizes, not just the largest."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:145
#: ac06982931324f098c861754590ccfb8
msgid ""
"**枚举模式产生过多超胞。** behavior_type=1 + max_atoms=500 + 原胞=2 原子 → 所有 ≤250 "
"倍原子数的组合都会被输出。如果不需要所有中间大小，改用 behavior_type=0 只取最大。"
msgstr ""
"**Enumeration produces too many cells.** Mode 1 emits all allowed "
"intermediate combinations. Use behavior 0 when only the largest selected "
"cell is needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:147
#: 1f263b72d0304eb89411587fba6f9817
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:149
#: 76f60b0a992949f599307df8e309175d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SC({na}x{nb}x{nc})` —— 如 `SC(4x4x4)`。"
msgstr "`SC({na}x{nb}x{nc})`, for example `SC(4x4x4)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:151
#: 5e73bb339de04948952452d592ee7d4c
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/super-cell-card.md:153
#: 7a3c3bb70b8d4e11ba052e89cbecfb02
msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。"
msgstr "Deterministic: identical inputs and parameters produce identical outputs."
